Breakpoints
  ok      a breakpoint in a loop stops on each iteration
  ok      breakpoint on STOP RUN
  ok      breakpoint on the last statement of the program
  ok      breakpoints added while stopped are hit
  ok      removed breakpoints are not hit anymore
  ok      disabled breakpoints are not hit
  ok      breakpoints outside the procedure division are never hit
  BUG?    conditional breakpoint with a COBOL condition stops only when it holds
            -> I at the first stop: expected 3, got 1
  BUG?    hit-count breakpoint stops on the given hit
            -> I at the first stop: expected 3, got 1
  BUG?    breakpoint on a comment line stops at the next statement
            -> the program terminated instead of stopping
  no bug  breakpoint on a paragraph header stops at the paragraph
  BUG?    function breakpoint on the program name stops in the program
            -> the program terminated instead of stopping
  BUG?    function breakpoint on a paragraph name stops in the paragraph
            -> the program terminated instead of stopping
